# Refactor wave boundaries

When working on branch `refactor/w1*` or `refactor/w2*`:

1. Read `docs/refactor/WAVE-1-SPEC.md` — edit **only** files listed for your agent ID.
2. Do not merge your own branch; notify orchestrator (see `.cursor/skills/refactor-orchestrator/SKILL.md`).
3. Finish with `yarn tsc && yarn test && yarn build`.
4. CTFFramework invariants unchanged unless `docs/CHANGELOG.md` documents a break.

If unsure which agent owns a file, stop and check `docs/refactor/REFACTOR-STATUS.md`.
